artistic contributions only; ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["The OSM outline gives 15 m total height and a hipped roof. The roof eave at 10.8 m is inferred from the inspected courtyard facade.","The photograph establishes the pale dressed-stone facade, regular tall bays, projecting cornices and dark hipped roof. Chimneys and figural carving are simplified away.","The one unheighted mapped part is treated as a subsidiary plan feature, not an invented taller wing."],"source":{"url":"/objects/0931a19c1d8cf5882eb7783dfbec826db0cbeddea45ca29d6e0eeefd3b273a40/source.blend.gz","bytes":118347,"sha256":"0931a19c1d8cf5882eb7783dfbec826db0cbeddea45ca29d6e0eeefd3b273a40"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/f5cb61d48c00b00ff767504e5da123a3080f26406bc41ce15af1c4032ae66722/spatial-source.json","bytes":6151,"sha256":"f5cb61d48c00b00ff767504e5da123a3080f26406bc41ce15af1c4032ae66722"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/87686cf6b020f02cdc93e6bf462a5a367c453bb4dc9dda200370b8bf72bdaea7/preview.webp","bytes":7430,"sha256":"87686cf6b020f02cdc93e6bf462a5a367c453bb4dc9dda200370b8bf72bdaea7"},"revision":"1f42b7a47576f2d20a67be6a2208e58304588f708f42e75d6e377a2f0d3387cc","publicationRevision":"cf34199df56d4ea93feb9a975da7c5cb8f6f7bd350ec79c5720b4e4f68aac28e","bounds":[2.3614871,48.8565396,2.3623054,48.8571987],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"808c7d2073c712316c3ada02d6762b49c869f1e88399736045303c3739e4b7a4","url":"/materials/808c7d2073c712316c3ada02d6762b49c869f1e88399736045303c3739e4b7a4.json"},"metadata":"/assets/hotel-de-lamoignon/cf34199df56d4ea93feb9a975da7c5cb8f6f7bd350ec79c5720b4e4f68aac28e/asset.json","validation":"/assets/hotel-de-lamoignon/cf34199df56d4ea93feb9a975da7c5cb8f6f7bd35